msgstr "在選定期間內有記錄活動的獨特任務。圖表顯示每日的獨特任務數量，而非累計總數。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/build_entity_live.ex:975
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Measured file compilation durations during the selected period. Missing measurements are excluded; genuine measured zeros are included."
msgstr "在選定期間內測量的檔案編譯持續時間。缺少測量數據的情況會被排除；真實測量為零的情況則會包含在內。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/build_entity_live.ex:863
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Recorded action execution failures during the selected period. Unknown outcomes are not counted as successes or failures."
msgstr "在選定期間內記錄的操作執行失敗次數。未知結果不會被計為成功或失敗。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/build_entity_live.ex:869
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Recorded file compilation failures during the selected period. Unknown outcomes are not counted as successes or failures."
msgstr "記錄選定期間內嘅檔案編譯失敗次數。未知結果唔會計入成功或失敗。"

